  "2026-09-05T04:18:32.077Z","harness:codex","Implemented schema/package execution roles, shared SDK classification and explicit selector opt-ins, visible gate/container worklists, context placement, budget compaction, and final-delivery feedback. Final local delivery evidence: pnpm quality:static passed; 8420 tests in 608 files passed with exact coverage statements 62214/62214, branches 47182/47182, functions 12920/12920, lines 59840/59840. Full typecheck, all six linked PM test runs, package-first dogfood (88 commands), temporary Node and Bun manual workflows, packed npm/npx/bunx consumers, compatibility migration, package artifact, docs/skills, SDK surface and contract checks passed. Refusal corpus closes 117/117 probes with negative controls; task-token corpus completes 8/8 tasks at 12667 estimated tokens. Tracker-context 41 assertions, graph-composition 10 assertions, and record-integrity pass. GitHub security inventories and pnpm audit are zero; fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes. PR review, merge, and publication remain separate subsequent claims."
