  "2026-09-05T05:41:25.923Z","harness:codex","Full PR 1195 rereview clarification: selectActionableEntries intentionally returns ready, decisions and gates. Eligible opted-in containers enter ready, subject to execution role; report.containers retains classification. Existing typed tests prove this. Documented the distinction and moved the execution contract page into the Documentation Map."
  "2026-09-05T05:47:55.689Z","harness:codex","PR 1195 full rereview corrections passed 63 focused tests, the real 8-task transcript gate with unchanged token ceilings, full typecheck, and the isolated 8422-test coverage suite. Coverage is statements 62222/62222, branches 47193/47193, functions 12920/12920, lines 59846/59846. Hosted CI 33946213771 passed on the previous reviewed head, including Windows; the corrected head will receive a new complete check and review round before merge."
