  "2026-09-05T06:52:30.012Z","harness:codex","Post-merge release proof refused main 22a7a1a9b: CodeFactor check 101263771803 is success but has one notice at src/sdk/context-usage.ts:190 (unicorn/no-useless-spread). The required hosted-analysis gate correctly rejects any outstanding annotation. The local installed Unicorn rule did not report this conditional-array shape even when enabled explicitly. The pre-merge process missed running the stricter existing hosted-analysis command; no gate is being weakened. Fix the redundant outer array in a reviewed follow-up and run the exact-head hosted-analysis gate before merging it."
  "2026-09-05T06:54:20.886Z","harness:codex","Removed the redundant outer array/spread from collectNextResultItemIds while preserving the fresh mutable accumulator and all visible-row traversal. Existing context-usage packing, final-egress, relevance and execution-role regressions pass, as does complete ESLint. The current main release gate remains correctly refused until this source correction lands with explicit zero-annotation analyzer proof. Before the follow-up merge, run hosted-analysis-gate on the exact new PR head, not only gh pr checks success states."
