  "2026-07-26T10:54:59.467Z","harness:claude-code","Context-side instance 2026-07-26: the gate-recommendation defect is not confined to pm next. On this workspace pm context --limit 2 returns pm-doxj, the roadmap-root Milestone, and pm-j82fd3, an outcome-milestone gate, as both of its low_level rows — that is, the two most actionable detail rows an agent is shown are the two least executable items in the tracker. Whatever lifecycle-role or container predicate resolves the pm next half must be shared with context assembly rather than applied at one call site."
